Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 05:01:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Fix GitHub updater Chromium style and bump Ver 1.1 (003)

---
 chrome/app/app-Info.plist                           |  4 ++--
 chrome/browser/ui/webui/help/BUILD.gn               | 13 +++++++------
 chrome/browser/ui/webui/help/aegis_github_update.h  |  6 +++---
